#: contents/ui/components/Labels.qml
msgid ""
"The Fix pill names the stage the fix currently sits in, and “fixed” once it reached the channel this system updates from (nixos-unstable or nixos-XX.YY):\n"
"\n"
"• fixed — the system's channel has a fixed version. Updating the channel fixes the finding.\n"
"• staging — merged into staging-next/staging; it lands in master when the next staging cycle is merged.\n"
"• master — master has it; the channel picks it up with the next channel bump (on a stable system a backport is still needed).\n"
"• 26.05 — fixed on another line; it is not on the way to this system's channel.\n"
"• issue — nothing is merged yet, but the Nixpkgs security issue is open.\n"
"• no fix — still affected in every branch that was checked.\n"
"• unknown / n/a / — — no verdict, no coverage, or no data.\n"
"\n"
"Hover the Fix pill for the per-branch table (✓ fixed, ✗ affected, ? unknown), the next step, and ← marking the channel this system runs."
msgstr ""

